WEBVTT

00:09.380 --> 00:11.950
Seated before me are a witch and an angel.

00:11.950 --> 00:16.720
This ageless woman is Queen Laura of Astarl. 
In other words, Prince Clarke's mother.

00:16.720 --> 00:18.730
She'll be my mother-in-law one day.

00:18.730 --> 00:20.710
Well, I'm still trying to break my engagement.

00:20.710 --> 00:24.830
And this little angel is the second 
prince of Astarl, Prince Matthias.

00:24.830 --> 00:26.860
He's Prince Clarke's younger brother.

00:26.860 --> 00:29.930
Ah! Lettie!

02:14.390 --> 02:18.330
My, Lettie, you certainly seem
 to adore Matthias.

02:18.330 --> 02:22.650
Yes, I just love him. 
And his squishy little cheeks.

02:24.260 --> 02:27.380
Goodness. How charming.

02:27.380 --> 02:30.960
He's so cute! 
I wish I could have him as my own!

02:34.720 --> 02:38.240
Matthias, what do you think you're doing?

02:38.240 --> 02:40.300
Brudder scawwy!

02:40.300 --> 02:43.730
Prince Clarke! He's just a child! 
What are you doing?

02:43.730 --> 02:45.270
No!

02:49.020 --> 02:52.070
I'd like to think my cheeks 
are fairly soft too, you know?

02:52.630 --> 02:56.450
Don't give Matthias all the attention. 
Save some affection for me, okay?

02:57.850 --> 03:02.430
So then your head was filled with thoughts 
of having a baby with Prince Clarke?

03:03.240 --> 03:05.910
Gracious. You're never this clumsy.

03:06.650 --> 03:08.670
It's because you're saying such weird stuff!

03:08.670 --> 03:11.170
But it's bound to happen eventually, isn't it?

03:11.170 --> 03:15.880
It's still too early for that. I mean, 
we must follow the proper steps here.

03:16.950 --> 03:18.930
Wait, no. I mean break off the engagement.

03:18.930 --> 03:22.400
You're still opposed to it? 
His Highness says he'll only have heirs wi—

03:22.400 --> 03:25.640
Hold it right there!
Do you know what you're saying?

03:25.640 --> 03:28.480
That isn't a conversation 
to have in front of strangers!

03:28.480 --> 03:31.010
Oh, it's all right. We weren't listening.

03:31.010 --> 03:33.110
That's exactly what you'd say if you <i>were</i>.

03:33.430 --> 03:35.520
You're opposed to it, but not wholeheartedly.

03:35.520 --> 03:38.570
So as long as he follows proper steps, 
you'd welcome it, correct?

03:38.570 --> 03:40.420
That's not what I meant at all!

03:40.420 --> 03:41.800
Oh yeah?

03:42.560 --> 03:45.560
Your face is as red as a lobster right now.

03:45.560 --> 03:47.750
Learn to keep your cool like Maria does.

03:47.750 --> 03:51.240
I will not be pleased if you 
continue to harass the missus.

03:51.240 --> 03:52.060
Okay!

03:52.060 --> 03:54.230
Uh-oh. I think the prince liked that.

03:54.230 --> 03:55.740
Lyle, she means you too!

03:55.740 --> 03:57.220
Okay!

03:56.230 --> 03:57.220
I swear...

04:06.390 --> 04:08.990
Brianna? Is something wrong?

04:08.990 --> 04:11.160
Huh? Oh, it's nothing.

04:11.160 --> 04:13.100
I'm sick of this!

04:13.570 --> 04:19.220
I don't wanna listen to you guys blather on. 
I wanna talk to Maria instead!

04:19.220 --> 04:20.770
That won't do.

04:20.770 --> 04:23.830
Then let's slip out alone and go on a date!

04:23.830 --> 04:25.060
I will not go.

04:25.060 --> 04:26.540
Oh, don't be shy.

04:26.540 --> 04:28.270
I'm not getting through to him...

04:28.270 --> 04:30.040
Don't hit on someone's lady-in-waiting!

04:30.040 --> 04:34.750
No way! I wanna go on a date 
with Maria while we're here!

04:35.060 --> 04:38.720
In this mysterious, foreign land 
where nobody knows us,

04:38.720 --> 04:42.400
just us two spending deep moments 
of sweet passion together...

04:42.400 --> 04:44.330
You're seriously creeping her out.

04:44.330 --> 04:45.760
Maria!

04:45.760 --> 04:47.100
Ah! Missus!

04:47.100 --> 04:48.970
Yeah, yeah, yeah!

04:47.100 --> 04:51.410
I told you to stop it! 
Would you back me up here, Brianna?

04:51.410 --> 04:52.820
Maria!

04:52.820 --> 04:53.740
Brianna?

04:53.740 --> 04:55.570
Huh? Sorry, what are we talking about?

04:55.570 --> 04:56.570
D'wah!

04:56.570 --> 05:00.610
Hey, you've been acting strange. 
It's like you're a million leagues away.

05:01.860 --> 05:03.030
Did something happen?

05:03.900 --> 05:07.410
Have you and Prince Clarke 
been getting along all right?

05:07.410 --> 05:08.370
Wuh?

05:08.370 --> 05:10.410
I saw something.

05:10.410 --> 05:13.960
Prince Clarke getting cozy with a tall,
 beautiful mystery woman.

05:14.570 --> 05:16.420
A tall, beautiful woman?

05:22.080 --> 05:24.730
Kind of a scandalous twist, isn't it?

05:24.730 --> 05:26.070
Lubba dubba!

05:26.070 --> 05:28.220
Are you sure it's not some misunderstanding?

05:28.220 --> 05:32.160
I saw it with my own eyes. 
I couldn't hear what they were talking about,

05:32.160 --> 05:34.730
but the mood was, well, intense.

05:34.730 --> 05:37.010
I saw them myself at the evening ball.

05:37.560 --> 05:39.440
He was with someone gorgeous.

05:39.440 --> 05:42.650
Missus, I'm sure there is an explanation.

05:45.530 --> 05:47.020
Leticia...

05:50.230 --> 05:53.120
What the actual heck?!

05:53.120 --> 05:55.130
Oh, here we go.

05:55.130 --> 05:58.090
I can't leave this room 
without Prince Clarke's permission,

05:58.090 --> 06:01.440
and meanwhile he's diddling around 
with some tall, leggy babe?

06:01.440 --> 06:02.380
Unforgivable!

06:02.780 --> 06:04.080
"Diddling"?

06:04.080 --> 06:05.710
Such crass language!

06:05.710 --> 06:06.570
Maria.

06:06.570 --> 06:08.210
Yes, missus?

06:08.210 --> 06:11.070
What's Prince Clarke's current 
visitation schedule?

06:11.070 --> 06:12.600
Nothing for today.

06:13.110 --> 06:16.890
It's been four days since I saw him during my
audience with Lord Matthias and the queen!

06:18.610 --> 06:22.530
Whatever happened to "save some
 affection for me, okay," huh?!

06:30.090 --> 06:31.290
Time to bust some skulls.

06:31.290 --> 06:32.250
What?

06:32.250 --> 06:33.160
Huh?

06:33.160 --> 06:34.040
Heh?

06:34.040 --> 06:34.960
Oho?

06:35.580 --> 06:36.380
Hmph!

06:36.380 --> 06:38.980
Wait, missus, wait! Please stay calm!

06:38.980 --> 06:41.210
How could I stay calm about this?!

06:41.210 --> 06:44.090
Yikes. Things are getting out of hand.

06:44.090 --> 06:46.170
Things are getting interesting!

06:46.170 --> 06:48.590
Sounds we're headed for a bloodbath.

06:48.590 --> 06:50.390
Do you hear yourselves?

06:51.850 --> 06:54.230
I cannot allow you to leave your room!

06:54.640 --> 06:56.320
Step aside.

06:56.320 --> 06:57.850
I cannot.

07:00.240 --> 07:02.860
Then go out and find the truth.

07:02.860 --> 07:04.070
What?

07:04.070 --> 07:05.570
Brianna!

07:06.760 --> 07:08.030
What is it?

07:08.430 --> 07:09.880
You're helping her.

07:09.880 --> 07:11.790
No way! Not a chance.

07:11.790 --> 07:14.440
I don't want to get caught up in any trouble.

07:14.440 --> 07:16.040
I'm leaving anyway.

07:16.040 --> 07:18.220
I'll pay you twice what Prince Clarke does.

07:18.220 --> 07:19.250
Missus!

07:22.250 --> 07:24.010
Sure! I'd be glad to!

07:24.010 --> 07:25.940
Heh. I'm counting on you.

07:26.970 --> 07:28.830
Just leave it to me!

07:28.830 --> 07:31.600
What a brilliant negotiator.

07:31.600 --> 07:33.010
Women are terrifying!

07:33.820 --> 07:36.250
Okay, let's begin investigating at once.

07:36.250 --> 07:37.980
Where should we start?

07:38.330 --> 07:42.120
Man, I've never seen you this excited 
for something before.

07:42.120 --> 07:45.330
You've got a sparkle 
in your eye too, Your Highness.

07:45.330 --> 07:50.420
I get to throw another dude under the bus 
and show Maria what I'm really made of!

07:50.420 --> 07:52.590
You're such a scoundrel!

07:52.590 --> 07:54.200
We can hear you, you know?

07:54.640 --> 07:58.890
Either way, should we really be 
suspecting Prince Clarke like this?

07:58.890 --> 08:01.210
He is my employer, after all.

08:01.210 --> 08:03.350
Well, I feel the same way.

08:03.350 --> 08:07.120
But there are some things even 
employers shouldn't get away with.

08:07.120 --> 08:09.720
I'm taking Leticia's side on this one.

08:10.050 --> 08:12.990
Oh, so you weren't merely 
swayed by the money?

08:13.860 --> 08:15.870
Er, of course not.

08:15.870 --> 08:17.790
Still, this is quite a shock.

08:17.790 --> 08:22.130
I always believed Prince Clarke 
loved the missus with all his heart.

08:22.130 --> 08:23.690
I suppose he gave in to temptation.

08:23.690 --> 08:26.940
A man of principles must 
be able to manage his lovers.

08:26.940 --> 08:28.230
Mm-hmm, mm-hmm.

08:28.230 --> 08:31.980
Huh?! Does a man who treats women 
like this have any principles whatsoever?

08:33.800 --> 08:36.700
We're going to find who
he's truly in love with.

08:37.760 --> 08:41.300
Now that you mention it, there is 
a very attractive guest at the castle.

08:41.300 --> 08:42.790
A tall, beautiful woman?

08:42.790 --> 08:46.160
Tall, slender, and very glamorous.

08:46.570 --> 08:49.770
She <i>was</i> standing very close 
to Prince Clarke, indeed!

08:49.770 --> 08:53.300
She even wiped the corner of 
His Highness's mouth with a handkerchief.

08:53.300 --> 08:55.510
I believe I saw her dancing as well,

08:55.510 --> 08:59.170
although it was slightly different 
in style from Astarlian dance.

08:59.170 --> 09:02.170
With a hand on the hip, and oh-so close!

09:04.600 --> 09:05.920
You didn't hear this from me,

09:05.920 --> 09:10.260
but that tall beauty is constantly being
summoned to His Highness's room.

09:11.720 --> 09:15.660
It's obvious that tall beauty 
is after Prince Clarke's heart.

09:15.660 --> 09:17.400
Do you think so?

09:17.400 --> 09:20.910
And His Highness doesn't seem to mind one bit.

09:20.910 --> 09:24.000
I saw them together on the balcony 
in a passionate embrace.

09:24.000 --> 09:25.200
Oh, stop!

09:28.130 --> 09:31.600
This is even more cramped 
than before. Dang it.

09:31.600 --> 09:36.050
Ouch! Ow, ow, ow, ow, ow, ow, ow!

09:40.630 --> 09:42.940
Prince Clarke, you big dummy.

09:47.240 --> 09:50.500
Prince Clarke is a very gracious man,

09:50.500 --> 09:54.110
and he was very concerned 
about your situation.

09:54.110 --> 09:58.700
Qualifying tests for ladies-in-waiting 
to the royal family are very difficult,

09:58.700 --> 10:02.030
but he made an exception 
for the daughter of the Slalemur family,

10:02.030 --> 10:05.210
who earned his trust through 
years of their loyal friendship.

10:05.210 --> 10:07.030
Please be diligent in your duties.

10:07.030 --> 10:08.210
Yes, sir.

10:09.220 --> 10:11.340
Is Madam Slalemur well?

10:11.340 --> 10:12.310
Yes.

10:12.310 --> 10:14.840
The climate here seems rather
 good for her health,

10:14.840 --> 10:17.100
and she is enjoying a peaceful life.

10:17.900 --> 10:20.560
Well, I am pleased to hear that.

10:22.040 --> 10:23.560
Thank you very much.

10:23.900 --> 10:26.700
Indeed. Sebastian, if you would.

10:26.700 --> 10:28.070
As you wish.

10:29.060 --> 10:32.240
If anything happens to Leticia, 
please ring this to let me know.

10:32.630 --> 10:34.480
Yes, very well.

10:34.940 --> 10:37.200
From now on, please take care of Leticia.

10:37.200 --> 10:38.630
You can count on me.

10:48.020 --> 10:50.370
Please excuse me. 
Missus, you should prepare—

10:50.370 --> 10:51.430
Maria!

10:51.430 --> 10:52.490
Yes?

10:52.490 --> 10:54.020
Oh!

10:54.020 --> 10:55.130
Missus?

10:55.510 --> 10:58.390
I started feeling so lonely 
with everybody gone!

10:58.390 --> 11:01.820
I'm so glad you came back, Maria!

11:03.770 --> 11:08.240
Missus, I am employed by Prince Clarke.

11:08.860 --> 11:10.110
Uh-huh.

11:10.560 --> 11:16.740
So I must obey his instructions, 
and I mean to support his decisions in love.

11:17.220 --> 11:19.500
However, I feel even more strongly

11:20.880 --> 11:24.750
that I want you to be 
happy in marriage, missus.

11:25.510 --> 11:26.810
Maria...

11:30.650 --> 11:32.080
What's taking them?

11:32.080 --> 11:35.260
Those two can't keep the guards 
distracted for much longer.

11:35.260 --> 11:36.940
As if!

11:41.660 --> 11:43.680
To be or not to be...

11:44.580 --> 11:46.060
That is the question.

11:52.180 --> 11:53.980
I have some reliable intel.

11:53.980 --> 11:57.990
Prince Clarke and the tall beauty just 
departed together in a horse-drawn carriage.

11:58.430 --> 12:01.980
It seems they're going shopping in the 
royal quarter, so we can easily catch up.

12:04.000 --> 12:05.370
Leticia?

12:05.880 --> 12:07.510
I...

12:07.510 --> 12:09.900
What is it? Wanna quit?

12:09.900 --> 12:11.840
Sometimes love means looking the other way.

12:13.200 --> 12:16.780
No. I want to know the truth.

12:16.780 --> 12:21.250
I want to know how Prince Clarke truly feels. 
I want to look him in the eye.

12:21.250 --> 12:22.600
Missus...

12:23.470 --> 12:25.220
That's more like it, Leticia.

12:25.220 --> 12:28.720
Maria, watch over things here while we're out.

12:28.720 --> 12:30.150
Leave everything to me.

12:30.850 --> 12:34.110
Thank you so much. 
I'm so glad I have you, Maria.

12:34.420 --> 12:35.530
Of course.

12:35.530 --> 12:37.650
Okay, let's get going!

12:51.880 --> 12:54.170
It's more crowded than I expected.

12:54.170 --> 12:55.820
I wonder if we'll find them.

12:55.820 --> 12:57.490
Well, I'm sure it'll work out.

12:57.490 --> 13:01.020
Although we might get distracted 
by all these fancy shops.

13:01.020 --> 13:02.090
Hey now!

13:02.090 --> 13:04.860
You haven't been out 
in a while either, have you?

13:04.860 --> 13:07.970
I haven't, but we aren't here today for fun.

13:09.600 --> 13:10.890
That's them!

13:10.890 --> 13:12.600
Wuh? Where, where?

13:12.600 --> 13:13.880
Look! Over there.

13:14.830 --> 13:17.310
This is a little too far. We're moving in.

13:17.310 --> 13:19.030
Huh? Oh...

13:23.570 --> 13:26.460
No use. Can't hear a word they're saying.

13:26.460 --> 13:28.340
Should we get a little closer?

13:28.340 --> 13:30.540
There's no good hiding spot.
It's too dangerous.

13:30.540 --> 13:32.060
We'd better observe them from here.

13:33.200 --> 13:35.070
They really do make a great couple.

13:35.070 --> 13:39.800
But they're keeping their distance. 
They aren't hugging or even holding hands.

13:40.140 --> 13:42.170
Maybe it's complicated.

13:42.720 --> 13:44.950
I've never seen him smile like that before.

13:46.400 --> 13:48.180
Wait, they're on the move!

14:03.070 --> 14:07.330
I never thought he'd take a lover into 
the sacred ground of a gentlemen's club.

14:07.330 --> 14:10.150
Pretty bold move. We can't let this slide.

14:10.150 --> 14:11.520
We're going in, Leticia!

14:11.520 --> 14:13.030
Wuh? In where?

14:13.030 --> 14:14.270
Isn't that obvious?

14:14.270 --> 14:17.340
He's in there with his lover. 
What choice do we have?

14:17.860 --> 14:19.570
Wait! I'm not emotionally prepared for—

14:19.570 --> 14:23.050
At a time like this, you need to step up 
as his bride-to-be and set him straight!

14:23.050 --> 14:24.890
It'll pay off in the long run!

14:26.090 --> 14:26.740
Huh?

14:26.740 --> 14:27.510
Hmm?

14:31.270 --> 14:32.480
Lettie!

14:33.890 --> 14:35.190
Go, go!

14:35.190 --> 14:36.380
Go!

14:38.390 --> 14:40.320
Good day to you, Prince Clarke.

14:40.700 --> 14:42.380
What are you doing here?

14:42.380 --> 14:44.320
May I ask who you're with?

14:44.320 --> 14:45.520
How did you get out?

14:45.520 --> 14:47.390
I'm the one asking questions here.

14:47.390 --> 14:50.330
Could it be you can't answer because
you're ashamed of your behavior?

14:50.330 --> 14:52.080
Me? Ashamed?

14:52.390 --> 14:54.330
My, how brazen!

14:54.990 --> 14:58.500
Just go back to the castle. 
I never said you could leave your room.

14:58.500 --> 15:02.710
You locked me in that room so you could 
go out and fool around, didn't you?

15:02.710 --> 15:03.760
Huh?

15:03.760 --> 15:07.840
Did you think I hadn't noticed? 
Well, too bad for you.

15:07.840 --> 15:11.100
I still have many loyal friends, 
I'll have you know.

15:11.100 --> 15:14.180
Prince Clarke, I have seen 
through your little scheme!

15:14.490 --> 15:15.780
What are you talking about?

15:15.780 --> 15:17.410
Oh, don't play innocent with me!

15:17.410 --> 15:19.940
I know you've been all touchy-feely 
with this tall beauty!

15:19.940 --> 15:22.480
Lettie, you've got it all wrong. This is...

15:26.800 --> 15:30.530
A pleasure to meet you, Lady Leticia.

15:30.530 --> 15:31.660
A man!

15:31.660 --> 15:36.160
I am a duke of Delbaran. My name is Neil.

15:37.110 --> 15:39.360
A... duke?

15:39.360 --> 15:44.420
Neil is the king's younger brother, 
which makes him Prince Louis's uncle.

15:44.420 --> 15:46.420
Huh... Oh!

15:52.590 --> 15:56.030
Your Grace Duke Neil, 
my name is Leticia Dorman.

15:56.030 --> 15:58.470
Please forgive my entirely 
inappropriate behavior.

15:59.020 --> 16:01.400
Prince Clarke, then is...

16:01.400 --> 16:05.620
The duke and I meet occasionally 
to attend to official duties.

16:05.620 --> 16:10.440
I am here for an extended stay this time, 
so even outside of official duties,

16:10.440 --> 16:13.700
I have been able to enjoy a fair 
amount of time with His Highness.

16:13.700 --> 16:16.580
You mean... you're not dating?

16:16.580 --> 16:21.950
Oh dear. Does the fact that I dress 
as a woman make you uncomfortable?

16:21.950 --> 16:23.750
Um, well...

16:23.750 --> 16:25.560
I suppose I cannot blame you.

16:26.440 --> 16:29.090
To be sure, I am quite beautiful, aren't I?

16:29.090 --> 16:30.050
Hmm?

16:30.050 --> 16:36.310
And when I don a lovely gown, 
it elevates my beauty to a whole other level!

16:41.020 --> 16:42.440
A narcissist!

16:42.790 --> 16:45.420
The duke sure is fun to watch, isn't he?

16:45.840 --> 16:48.150
I'm not quite sure how to react yet.

16:48.150 --> 16:49.150
Ah...

16:49.590 --> 16:55.930
By the way, I do not dress like this 
because I am attracted to Prince Clarke,

16:55.930 --> 16:57.830
so you can relax about that.

16:58.320 --> 16:59.710
Phew!

16:59.710 --> 17:03.670
I simply want to honor 
the beauty I was blessed with.

17:06.140 --> 17:11.240
Now, Prince Clarke, I have concluded
 my business, so I will be going back.

17:11.240 --> 17:15.980
Oh, that's right. Why don't the two of you 
take this opportunity to go out on the town?

17:15.980 --> 17:18.810
I doubt you get many chances like this.

17:18.810 --> 17:20.850
Well then, bonne journée.

17:25.140 --> 17:26.280
Okay.

17:29.020 --> 17:33.060
I'm so sorry! I misunderstood 
and jumped to all these conclusions

17:33.060 --> 17:36.160
and got everyone to help me sneak out
and started following you!

17:36.160 --> 17:39.690
All because I heard you were with a tall beauty
and couldn't keep my cool about it!

17:39.690 --> 17:41.900
And I ended up interrupting your duties!

17:41.900 --> 17:43.290
I'm the one who should apologize.

17:44.700 --> 17:46.420
It's clear that I upset you.

17:46.830 --> 17:48.590
Prince Clarke...

17:48.590 --> 17:51.700
Say, why don't we go 
on a secret date right now?

17:51.700 --> 17:52.930
Wuh?

18:02.390 --> 18:04.360
Are you sure you'll be okay?

18:04.360 --> 18:07.610
I know what I'm doing. I just 
exchange it for one of these, right?

18:07.610 --> 18:10.940
That's right. You choose an item, 
place an order...

18:10.940 --> 18:13.710
You're such a worrywart, Lettie. 
Wait right there.

18:13.710 --> 18:16.070
Hey! You don't have to run!

18:16.070 --> 18:19.430
Um, pardon me. 
Would you please let me through?

18:19.430 --> 18:22.040
Uh... Huh? Wh-Wh-Whoa!

18:25.940 --> 18:27.310
I bought one!

18:27.310 --> 18:28.520
Huh?

18:28.520 --> 18:31.370
Lettie, I really bought one!

18:33.120 --> 18:34.180
I bought one!

18:40.070 --> 18:41.310
Is it to your liking?

18:41.310 --> 18:43.870
I've never tasted anything like it! 
It's delicious!

18:43.870 --> 18:45.200
Try some, Lettie.

18:45.200 --> 18:46.550
All right.

18:48.540 --> 18:51.610
Yum! It's so fresh and refreshingly sweet!

18:52.570 --> 18:53.530
Oh!

18:53.900 --> 18:56.160
Hmm? Is something the matter?

18:57.710 --> 18:58.870
That...

18:59.950 --> 19:00.950
This?

19:02.640 --> 19:04.830
That was an indirect kiss!

19:04.830 --> 19:07.600
Wuh?! Wh-What are you talking about?

19:09.670 --> 19:11.890
Would you wipe that look off your face?

19:11.890 --> 19:13.800
Grinning just comes naturally to me.

19:14.220 --> 19:17.000
I'll keep this straw as a souvenir 
from our first date!

19:17.000 --> 19:19.300
Don't make that a souvenir!

19:21.750 --> 19:24.560
Everyone seems so happy here, don't they?

19:24.560 --> 19:25.710
Come on.

19:24.990 --> 19:25.710
They sure do.

19:25.710 --> 19:27.240
Gimme some.

19:25.710 --> 19:27.620
Sounds like she just had her baby.

19:27.620 --> 19:28.650
Really?

19:33.310 --> 19:36.380
I want to protect this peace 
for as long as I can.

19:44.580 --> 19:45.620
Hmm?

19:45.620 --> 19:47.930
No, it's nothing.

19:48.490 --> 19:50.530
Lettie, hold out your hands.

19:50.530 --> 19:51.880
Like this?

19:54.290 --> 19:55.570
What's this?

19:55.570 --> 19:56.880
In honor of today.

20:05.430 --> 20:07.600
Oh, it's so cute!

20:07.600 --> 20:09.340
What kind of animal is this?

20:09.340 --> 20:13.280
One native to the Kingdom 
of Delbaran. It's called a milou.

20:13.280 --> 20:14.750
Wow.

20:14.750 --> 20:19.110
The milou is said to be very faithful in love, 
so the people are very fond of it.

20:19.600 --> 20:22.460
They say it's the perfect gift 
for someone dear to you.

20:22.460 --> 20:23.870
I'm sure it is.

20:24.400 --> 20:27.360
Also, doesn't this milou look 
a little bit like you, Lettie?

20:27.360 --> 20:28.720
Like me?

20:28.720 --> 20:31.880
It's charming in appearance, 
with eyes filled with determination.

20:33.870 --> 20:35.340
Do you like it?

20:35.340 --> 20:36.830
Yes!

20:36.830 --> 20:39.440
Ah, I'm so glad!

20:42.800 --> 20:47.580
Prince Clarke, I don't know much 
about things like love and romance.

20:47.580 --> 20:48.710
Mm-hmm.

20:48.710 --> 20:51.950
So I think it will take me quite some time.

20:51.950 --> 20:52.850
Mm-hmm.

20:52.850 --> 20:56.230
And I can't just ignore my desire for freedom.

20:56.230 --> 20:57.350
Mm-hmm.

20:57.350 --> 21:00.420
And I'll probably still run away 
from time to time.

21:00.420 --> 21:02.030
Mm-hmm. That's fine.

21:02.030 --> 21:03.990
Wuh? It is?

21:04.340 --> 21:08.500
Mm-hmm. But I will still 
always chase after you, Lettie.

21:08.500 --> 21:10.340
Prince Clarke...

21:13.100 --> 21:14.630
Shall we head back?

21:14.630 --> 21:15.810
Yes.

21:17.260 --> 21:19.760
Now don't they seem like a happy couple?

21:20.230 --> 21:23.010
Maybe she's finally taken the first step.

21:23.010 --> 21:28.240
I never would've guessed that you were 
actually Prince Clarke's lover, Uncle!

21:28.240 --> 21:31.040
That may not be the best way 
to phrase it, Highness.

21:31.040 --> 21:36.860
Ah, how hot the flames of jealousy burn 
inside a beautiful maiden's heart!

21:36.860 --> 21:40.540
Ah, how sinful indeed!

21:42.030 --> 21:44.720
And yet, I am only as sinful...

21:44.720 --> 21:46.780
as I am beautiful!

21:47.190 --> 21:49.690
Wow. This guy's a riot.

23:20.000 --> 23:40.020
<b>Next Time</b>

23:20.130 --> 23:25.130
Don't you think we'll see one? A ghost?

23:21.000 --> 23:26.010
If there is a ghost, I'll catch it and show it to you!

23:22.000 --> 23:27.010
...white face

23:23.010 --> 23:28.010
Is Prince Louis all right?

23:24.010 --> 23:29.010
You've no right to refuse

23:26.010 --> 23:31.010
What is this room?

23:27.390 --> 23:32.390
There's someone in the garden!

23:28.890 --> 23:33.890
Ghost! You're there, aren't you? Show yourself!

23:30.390 --> 23:35.390
I hear a strange sound!

23:31.890 --> 23:36.890
Do ghosts have legs?

23:37.350 --> 23:40.020
A girl's gotta keep her secrets
